  <div class="callout warning">
    <p><strong>Current status:</strong> The Preferred Alternative and its right-of-way are drafts. Comments are open through December 11, 2026, and the alignment becomes final only when UDOT approves the Final State Environmental Study, expected in early 2027.{% cite "udot-ses-schedule" %} Check a specific parcel against the Volume 2 mapbook, and ask UDOT's right-of-way staff about it before making decisions.{% cite "udot-draft-ses-vol2-nov2026" %}</p>
  </div>

  <h3>Draft State Environmental Study: Right-of-Way and Relocation Estimates</h3>

